# 🛡️ Mirage Helper v12

Target apps ke liye naya **anti-detection layer**. Purane Helper se upgrade karo, reboot.

### ✨ Naya kya aaya

- 🗂️ **Mount hide** — Magisk, `su`, `/data/adb` target app ko folder ki tarah nahi dikhte  
- 📄 **Maps filter** — `/proc/maps` file se magisk / lsposed / mirage lines hata ke saaf copy bind  
- 🎯 **Auto STEALTH** — jo apps tick hain, chalte hi hide (backup/restore ke time skip)  
- 👻 **Java + Helper** — APK me Anti-Root on rakho: Magisk / LSPosed / Mirage list se bhi gayab  

### ⚠️ Limit

Play Integrity / RAM scan nahi. Folder + APK list + maps **file** hide.

